control: Delta sync decides under backfill's gate thresholds and records backfill's scanner version and revision
removes: the worker hands delta sync an execution context of its own, whose scanner is built from a section of its own, so its verdicts and masks record another revision than backfill's
packages: ./worker/app
tests: TestBothJobKindsScanWithTheOneScanner
scheduled-count: no

